  "details": "I was giving tours to a couple players and one of them enabled emergency mode by accident, I could not talk nor interact with them during this and had to resort to calling the user via skype because they did not know how to disable it\n\nP L E A S E add a pop up every other minute to tell a user how to disable emergency mode or add a Big Ol' Button to the quick menu to turn off emergency mode instead of having users have to really on external resources to tell them how to disable it",
